WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.480
EPISODE 24

01:56.000 --> 01:58.600
Ah Zheng, the first time we met,

01:58.680 --> 02:00.560
you wouldn't let go of me.

02:00.640 --> 02:04.080
I know you've got a grievance, right?

02:24.840 --> 02:26.720
Twice the case was retried.

02:26.800 --> 02:28.360
You still wouldn't reveal the truth.

02:29.120 --> 02:30.280
Is someone threatening you?

02:32.640 --> 02:34.320
Or are they too powerful?

02:34.400 --> 02:36.280
Afraid your family will suffer?

02:57.400 --> 02:59.080
Do you have a theory, my lord?

02:59.800 --> 03:01.280
You've thought of it too, right?

03:02.720 --> 03:04.240
It must be a rich merchant

03:04.320 --> 03:05.400
or a high-ranked official.

03:06.000 --> 03:08.200
We must find the one
who truly terrifies her.

03:09.080 --> 03:10.800
Only then will we uncover the culprit.

03:10.880 --> 03:13.120
Even if she can't speak,

03:13.200 --> 03:14.520
she could've signaled somehow.

03:14.600 --> 03:15.720
But she was too scared

03:16.880 --> 03:17.960
to testify.

03:18.040 --> 03:20.000
It was busy with people that day.

03:20.600 --> 03:22.760
So many officers and workers passing by.

03:23.680 --> 03:25.160
Why did she only plead to Haode?

03:26.160 --> 03:28.360
And why stop once we showed up?

03:29.440 --> 03:32.080
That's why I want Haode

03:33.120 --> 03:34.200
to take another shot.

03:37.120 --> 03:38.720
After you were taken,

03:38.800 --> 03:41.800
Granny Zhang took her grandchild with her.

03:41.880 --> 03:44.720
She did laundry jobs for neighbors,

03:44.800 --> 03:46.240
barely earning 20 coins a day.

03:46.840 --> 03:47.920
Now,

03:48.000 --> 03:50.840
they've sold their countryside house
and came here.

03:51.440 --> 03:54.840
But they're living in temples
or under bridges.

03:55.480 --> 03:57.120
If you die,

03:58.080 --> 03:59.480
they won't survive much longer.

04:04.480 --> 04:06.840
Your last employer.

04:06.920 --> 04:09.120
Did you sign a short-term contract?

04:10.160 --> 04:11.360
Do you know where it was?

04:14.240 --> 04:16.600
If not,

04:17.200 --> 04:19.320
was there a plaque at the gate?

04:19.400 --> 04:20.920
Even if you can't read,

04:21.000 --> 04:22.520
you'd recognize the place, right?

04:22.600 --> 04:24.720
Was it the Lu's House,

04:24.800 --> 04:26.040
Wang's, or Li's?

04:26.840 --> 04:28.520
Here,

04:28.600 --> 04:30.040
point to the word

04:30.120 --> 04:31.840
on this page for me.

04:34.520 --> 04:36.640
Think carefully and show me.

04:38.840 --> 04:41.000
FAMILY NAMES YU, REN, YUAN

04:41.080 --> 04:43.400
FAMILY NAMES FEI, LIAN, CHEN

04:48.120 --> 04:50.480
FAMILY NAMES XUE, LEI, HE

04:55.000 --> 04:59.480
XUE

05:01.200 --> 05:03.280
She's timid and from the countryside.

05:04.040 --> 05:05.760
She only worked and didn't wander.

05:05.840 --> 05:07.560
She's unfamiliar

05:07.640 --> 05:09.800
with Bianjing's roads.

05:09.880 --> 05:12.720
She only knows the gate had the word Xue.

05:17.280 --> 05:19.480
XUE'S MANSION

05:26.680 --> 05:28.640
XUE'S MANSION

05:42.400 --> 05:45.160
XUE'S MANSION

05:47.840 --> 05:48.800
My lord,

05:48.880 --> 05:50.200
this is the last

05:50.280 --> 05:51.480
Xue's house in Bianjing.

05:53.920 --> 05:55.240
Let's head back.

05:55.320 --> 05:57.520
No, it's not the last one.

05:57.600 --> 06:00.000
- One more Xue family.
- Haode.

06:01.720 --> 06:03.280
The Grand Justice, Xue Guang.

06:03.360 --> 06:04.280
Doesn't he count?

06:11.880 --> 06:14.520
Brother, we've searched every house.

06:14.600 --> 06:16.520
Why skip this one?

06:16.600 --> 06:17.520
Don't tell me

06:17.600 --> 06:18.960
you don't trust him.

06:22.120 --> 06:23.040
Fine.

06:23.120 --> 06:24.600
Let's go back to Kaifeng Court

06:24.680 --> 06:25.520
and execute her.

06:25.600 --> 06:27.160
Pretend this never happened.

06:28.080 --> 06:29.560
- Qingshi.
- I'm here.

06:29.640 --> 06:30.800
Go to Xue's residence.

06:31.440 --> 06:32.520
Sure.

06:32.600 --> 06:33.560
Let's go.

06:38.400 --> 06:39.400
Sit here.

07:11.960 --> 07:12.880
Get off.

07:30.840 --> 07:32.600
Is this really the Xue residence?

07:34.360 --> 07:36.200
He visited Kaifeng Court that day.

07:36.280 --> 07:37.880
The next day, I paid him a visit here.

07:38.680 --> 07:39.560
Yes, it's this place.

07:45.560 --> 07:46.440
Jingwei.

07:47.360 --> 07:48.520
Jingwei.

07:48.600 --> 07:49.480
Sir.

07:55.320 --> 07:56.280
Sir.

07:56.880 --> 07:58.720
Have a seat.

08:04.200 --> 08:06.000
I've been an official for 40 years.

08:06.080 --> 08:07.760
I'm used to a modest lifestyle.

08:08.400 --> 08:10.720
My diet's simple, my clothes plain.

08:11.640 --> 08:13.800
This house is all I own.

08:13.880 --> 08:15.520
For years, I've only had

08:15.600 --> 08:17.360
one disabled old servant.

08:17.960 --> 08:19.480
My wife and young child

08:19.560 --> 08:20.720
live frugally with me.

08:20.800 --> 08:21.880
This is our life.

08:21.960 --> 08:23.520
With only three of us,

08:23.600 --> 08:25.280
we don't need maids or servants.

08:25.960 --> 08:28.040
I also fear a court official living here

08:28.120 --> 08:29.800
might attract gossip

08:29.880 --> 08:31.840
and shame.

08:31.920 --> 08:34.160
So, I've never hung a plaque.

08:37.120 --> 08:38.360
Someone needs proof.

08:38.440 --> 08:41.080
So, I had no choice.

08:41.160 --> 08:43.520
Forgive me for the intrusion.

08:44.200 --> 08:45.480
No need to apologize.

08:45.560 --> 08:46.560
I have nothing to hide.

08:46.640 --> 08:48.960
I've never done anything
to feel guilty about.

08:49.040 --> 08:50.880
So, I don't fear inspections.

08:50.960 --> 08:53.240
Are you satisfied now?

08:53.920 --> 08:56.560
Lord Xue, forgive my ignorance.

08:56.640 --> 08:57.520
You're a sage.

08:59.120 --> 09:00.160
No harm done.

09:03.000 --> 09:04.720
Please, have some tea.

09:04.800 --> 09:05.920
Try this.

09:27.640 --> 09:28.920
I have duties to attend to.

09:29.000 --> 09:30.680
I can't stay long to disturb you.

09:32.360 --> 09:34.720
I'll visit another day

09:34.800 --> 09:35.880
to apologize properly.

09:37.080 --> 09:39.280
- Goodbye.
- Take care.

10:12.400 --> 10:13.680
She can't read.

10:13.760 --> 10:15.280
What if she remembered wrong?

10:16.080 --> 10:17.840
Which surnames look like "Xue"?

10:18.480 --> 10:19.600
Which one?

10:22.040 --> 10:23.200
Qingshi.

10:23.280 --> 10:24.800
Sir.

10:24.880 --> 10:26.440
Tell Officer Du

10:26.520 --> 10:28.240
this case can't be delayed.

10:28.320 --> 10:30.000
If there's no solid proof,

10:30.080 --> 10:31.080
then uphold the verdict.

10:31.160 --> 10:33.840
Murdering her husband
deserves the death penalty.

10:55.520 --> 10:56.520
Oh.

10:56.600 --> 10:57.680
Keep investigating.

10:58.600 --> 10:59.840
- Sure.
- Go.

11:19.680 --> 11:21.120
XUE

11:30.480 --> 11:31.400
Dad.

11:32.160 --> 11:33.040
Is it okay now?

11:33.120 --> 11:34.920
You disgraceful child!

11:35.000 --> 11:37.720
My years of good name are ruined by you.

11:37.800 --> 11:40.840
I regret spoiling you.

11:40.920 --> 11:45.240
Now, you murder and commit sins!

11:45.320 --> 11:48.040
Why do I even need a son like you?

11:49.000 --> 11:51.360
Others are officials. So are you.

11:52.200 --> 11:54.280
Others live in luxury.

11:54.880 --> 11:57.440
But I've lived in this hut for 20 years.

11:57.520 --> 11:58.960
Why can't I enjoy myself?

11:59.040 --> 12:01.440
A lowly farmer died. So what?

12:01.520 --> 12:02.640
If you kill me for this,

12:02.720 --> 12:04.440
you'll cut off your bloodline.

12:04.520 --> 12:05.480
You!

12:13.360 --> 12:16.240
Kaifeng already sentenced her.

12:16.960 --> 12:19.120
She won't appeal again.

12:19.200 --> 12:21.520
But have you cleaned out
that private house yet?

12:21.600 --> 12:23.760
Especially those
who aided and abetted you.

12:23.840 --> 12:25.200
Well,

12:25.280 --> 12:27.080
it's okay with that house.

12:27.160 --> 12:28.280
But don't worry.

12:28.360 --> 12:29.480
I'll handle them.

12:30.400 --> 12:31.760
I also told someone

12:31.840 --> 12:33.480
to remove the plaque.

12:33.560 --> 12:34.760
Fool!

12:35.400 --> 12:37.680
There are not so many Xue houses here.

12:37.760 --> 12:40.880
Taking down the plaque now?
It's too suspicious!

12:40.960 --> 12:41.840
Dad.

12:42.680 --> 12:44.920
Dad. I'm your son.

12:45.000 --> 12:47.120
Save me, please.

12:47.200 --> 12:48.720
That Shen guy.

12:48.800 --> 12:50.120
He's your student, right?

12:50.200 --> 12:51.360
He'll listen to you!

12:51.440 --> 12:52.360
And that magistrate.

12:52.440 --> 12:54.560
He'll listen to you!

12:54.640 --> 12:56.880
- Enough.
- Dad.

12:56.960 --> 13:00.720
Are you just going to watch your son die?

13:01.600 --> 13:03.280
I beg you, Dad.

13:03.960 --> 13:06.120
Help me!

13:41.120 --> 13:42.520
I didn't want to come.

13:42.600 --> 13:45.480
Granny had my bedding moved.

13:45.560 --> 13:47.240
Leshan and Yinhong are sharing a bed.

13:47.320 --> 13:48.560
I couldn't go there too.

14:02.360 --> 14:04.360
Don't mind me. You go to sleep.

14:25.680 --> 14:26.680
I said don't mind me,

14:26.760 --> 14:28.200
and you really don't?

15:05.800 --> 15:07.200
Brother.

15:07.920 --> 15:09.800
She's innocent.

15:14.480 --> 15:15.600
She's innocent.

16:28.920 --> 16:31.120
You asked me to check Xue Sizu.

16:31.200 --> 16:33.080
I found a private house.

16:33.160 --> 16:34.640
Hurry!

16:34.720 --> 16:36.200
Hurry up!

16:36.280 --> 16:37.800
Be careful.

16:37.880 --> 16:41.040
Who'd have thought
Lord Xue lives so simply.

16:41.120 --> 16:44.320
Yet his son owns houses and keeps women.

16:44.400 --> 16:47.280
Apart from that, there's even a troupe.

16:48.280 --> 16:49.960
Did Zheng Su'e confirm it?

16:50.040 --> 16:50.960
Yes, sir.

16:51.640 --> 16:54.160
We arrested the servants there.

16:54.240 --> 16:55.440
They're being interrogated.

16:56.160 --> 16:58.160
About that culprit, Xue Sizu,

16:58.240 --> 17:01.000
should we arrest him now?

17:02.840 --> 17:03.800
Leave it to me.

17:05.120 --> 17:05.960
Sure.

17:16.880 --> 17:18.200
Brother?

18:24.480 --> 18:26.400
Why aren't you at Kaifeng Court today?

18:26.480 --> 18:28.640
Ruining my embroidery here instead?

18:29.280 --> 18:30.280
I'm done.

18:30.360 --> 18:32.000
I'm never going there.

18:33.040 --> 18:36.120
Shouhua, does Du always tell you

18:36.200 --> 18:37.240
what he thinks?

18:38.680 --> 18:40.480
Well, actually,

18:40.560 --> 18:42.280
he carries the weight

18:42.880 --> 18:44.680
and makes decisions on his own,

18:44.760 --> 18:46.400
never letting me worry.

18:47.280 --> 18:50.440
People say couples should
be open with each other.

18:50.520 --> 18:52.840
But how many truly are?

18:53.440 --> 18:55.480
It's all guesswork.

18:55.560 --> 18:56.920
Back and forth.

18:57.000 --> 18:58.680
That guessing's part of the fun.

18:58.760 --> 19:02.280
Otherwise, marriage would be dull.

19:03.760 --> 19:05.120
Haode,

19:05.720 --> 19:07.480
you're going to be Mrs. Shen now.

19:07.560 --> 19:08.840
Just listen to your husband.

19:08.920 --> 19:11.800
Zheng's life or death isn't your concern.

19:11.880 --> 19:14.440
But I can't forget her.

19:14.520 --> 19:16.840
They cut her tongue and broke her teeth.

19:17.680 --> 19:19.200
She was so beautiful once.

19:19.800 --> 19:21.680
Who could be so cruel?

19:21.760 --> 19:23.640
You mean

19:23.720 --> 19:25.920
someone tortured her to break her teeth?

19:28.040 --> 19:28.880
Shouhua,

19:28.960 --> 19:30.960
your ideas are genius.

19:31.040 --> 19:32.280
Those scoundrels.

19:32.360 --> 19:34.000
They all confessed.

19:36.840 --> 19:37.920
Yangxi.

19:38.000 --> 19:39.160
What's the occasion?

19:39.240 --> 19:40.120
Everyone's here.

19:41.200 --> 19:42.360
Greetings to you, Mr. Du.

19:43.560 --> 19:44.880
You're back.

19:44.960 --> 19:45.840
Yeah.

19:48.280 --> 19:50.400
The Zheng Su'e case troubles them.

19:51.880 --> 19:54.040
What case did you just say?

19:54.120 --> 19:55.200
Why so excited?

19:56.400 --> 19:58.080
It's not for young ladies to hear.

19:59.040 --> 20:00.080
Don't listen to him.

20:00.160 --> 20:02.160
It's just a love scandal.

20:02.240 --> 20:05.320
Sit at Sifu House for a day,

20:05.400 --> 20:07.400
you'll hear ten more.

20:07.480 --> 20:08.480
Why can't you say?

20:09.600 --> 20:11.440
That's just a ridiculous case.

20:12.160 --> 20:13.160
A woman surnamed Gao

20:13.240 --> 20:15.120
accused her neighbor of harassment.

20:15.200 --> 20:18.000
But her evidence was hard to verify.

20:18.680 --> 20:20.000
What evidence?

20:22.800 --> 20:24.360
Ask your Shouhua.

20:24.440 --> 20:25.600
I'm going to wash up.

20:27.200 --> 20:28.360
Shouhua.

20:32.320 --> 20:33.360
She said

20:33.440 --> 20:36.520
Liusheng snuck into her house.

20:36.600 --> 20:38.560
He harassed her when she was alone.

20:38.640 --> 20:40.480
He even bit her left chest hard.

20:41.280 --> 20:44.200
How can officers verify this?

20:44.800 --> 20:47.440
So, how was the case solved?

20:49.560 --> 20:54.360
Tell me what you did.

20:57.520 --> 20:59.160
What do you think?

21:01.320 --> 21:02.160
What?

21:05.120 --> 21:05.960
Look,

21:06.040 --> 21:08.600
checking a chest is tricky,

21:08.680 --> 21:10.360
but bite marks on food aren't.

21:11.040 --> 21:13.720
Match the teeth marks and it's clear.

21:14.440 --> 21:16.160
That's brilliant.

21:16.240 --> 21:18.560
You should become a magistrate.

21:18.640 --> 21:20.240
No one will be framed then.

21:27.400 --> 21:28.400
Where are you going?

21:32.440 --> 21:33.520
Du,

21:34.120 --> 21:36.040
what methods do courts use to coerce?

21:36.120 --> 21:38.000
Would Zheng be forced into confession?

21:38.600 --> 21:39.720
For women,

21:39.800 --> 21:41.680
they use finger clamps or flogging.

21:43.240 --> 21:45.040
But no more than 200 strikes by law.

21:45.760 --> 21:47.800
If she endures,

21:47.880 --> 21:49.640
they can't do anything.

21:49.720 --> 21:53.680
Even if she falsely confesses,
later, when the higher courts intervene

21:53.760 --> 21:55.720
and find out that she got beaten

21:55.800 --> 21:58.360
over 100 strikes, when the rightful
punishment is only 20,

21:58.440 --> 22:00.240
the magistrate
will take the rest themselves.

22:00.320 --> 22:02.160
They call it reverse penalty.

22:02.240 --> 22:03.240
Would they pull teeth?

22:04.640 --> 22:06.480
An oral confession.
What's the good in that?

22:07.720 --> 22:09.440
That would be a real false confession.

22:10.040 --> 22:11.400
Thank you.

22:12.840 --> 22:14.200
Haode.

22:14.280 --> 22:15.160
Haode.

22:17.040 --> 22:18.280
Haode.

22:19.840 --> 22:20.720
Shouhua.

22:21.360 --> 22:22.560
Are they…?

22:23.520 --> 22:24.480
Let me.

22:31.880 --> 22:33.840
Rare to see you resting today.

22:33.920 --> 22:36.680
Instead of taking your wife out,

22:36.760 --> 22:38.200
you came and visited me.

22:39.760 --> 22:41.520
I don't have fine food for you,

22:42.160 --> 22:44.960
but I made these preserves.

22:45.040 --> 22:47.560
I made them with imperial fruits.

22:47.640 --> 22:48.920
Here, have a taste.

22:49.560 --> 22:51.400
You are a good teacher.

22:51.480 --> 22:52.920
You care about me a lot.

22:54.320 --> 22:56.200
Today, I'll take this tea

22:56.280 --> 22:57.480
to show my respect.

23:02.400 --> 23:05.040
We're teacher and student,
like father and son.

23:05.120 --> 23:07.080
Why can't you just speak plainly?

23:07.160 --> 23:08.880
No need to be vague and evasive.

23:08.960 --> 23:10.920
Pardon my boldness.

23:11.000 --> 23:12.200
May I ask, Lord Xue?

23:12.280 --> 23:14.720
If a nobleman in the city

23:14.800 --> 23:17.640
abuses power and breaks laws
under his father's authority,

23:18.240 --> 23:19.640
shouldn't he be held accountable?

23:19.720 --> 23:20.680
What exactly did he do?

23:20.760 --> 23:22.440
He seized a maid named Ah Zheng,

23:22.520 --> 23:23.720
killed her husband,

23:24.440 --> 23:27.000
pinned the murder on another,

23:27.080 --> 23:28.920
and ordered the county magistrate

23:29.000 --> 23:30.440
to cut out Ah Zheng's tongue.

23:30.520 --> 23:33.640
His actions are vile and cruel,

23:33.720 --> 23:35.080
depraved, heinous,

23:35.160 --> 23:38.200
beyond redemption.

23:38.880 --> 23:40.040
Lord Shen,

23:41.000 --> 23:43.040
do you know how many cases

23:43.120 --> 23:44.200
I've handled?

23:49.440 --> 23:51.400
Even I've lost count.

23:52.000 --> 23:54.440
Can't my decades of merit

23:55.320 --> 23:57.400
be exchanged for his life?

24:06.400 --> 24:08.000
It's never hard to judge a case…

24:12.720 --> 24:13.840
but people's hearts.

24:14.920 --> 24:15.800
Last night,

24:15.880 --> 24:17.600
I kept thinking about this.

24:17.680 --> 24:21.520
The law was created based on human nature.

24:21.600 --> 24:23.600
Then the exceptions by human emotions

24:23.680 --> 24:26.040
are selfish desires.

24:26.840 --> 24:29.520
Unchecked feelings lead to injustice.

24:29.600 --> 24:32.200
Unchecked greed leads to chaos.

24:32.280 --> 24:35.080
When facing these exceptions,

24:35.160 --> 24:36.560
those who judge the cases

24:37.480 --> 24:39.040
should never be compromised.

24:42.520 --> 24:46.560
I hope you understand, Lord Xue.

24:59.880 --> 25:02.320
Sir, the young master
still insists on going.

25:06.000 --> 25:08.640
He's testing my patience.

25:08.720 --> 25:09.560
My lord,

25:09.640 --> 25:12.000
you can protect him.

25:13.040 --> 25:16.760
Yes, I can protect him.

25:16.840 --> 25:20.680
But compared to a reputation
I've built for decades,

25:20.760 --> 25:24.280
an heir means little to me.

25:26.720 --> 25:28.080
You've met that man,

25:28.160 --> 25:29.640
haven't you?

25:33.520 --> 25:35.880
That day, you weren't scared
because Lord Shen arrived.

25:35.960 --> 25:38.120
You were scared

25:38.200 --> 25:39.760
because you saw Xue Guang.

25:40.680 --> 25:41.920
You're afraid of him.

25:42.000 --> 25:44.720
Perhaps you saw him at the manor,

25:44.800 --> 25:46.760
knew he's a high-ranked official,

25:46.840 --> 25:48.920
so you couldn't cry for justice.

25:59.600 --> 26:01.320
Father, why are you here?

26:04.080 --> 26:06.760
Who let you set up a private house here?

26:07.920 --> 26:10.520
Father, let's talk inside.

26:16.920 --> 26:18.720
Oh heavens.

26:19.600 --> 26:20.600
I see now.

26:23.280 --> 26:24.120
Your teeth

26:24.960 --> 26:27.960
weren't pulled during interrogation.

26:29.120 --> 26:31.000
They were knocked out

26:32.440 --> 26:33.640
while resisting assault.

26:35.600 --> 26:36.800
I know

26:36.880 --> 26:38.600
you don't trust the officials.

26:39.200 --> 26:42.080
But my husband isn't like them.

26:43.560 --> 26:44.920
If you trust me,

26:45.680 --> 26:46.760
trust him too.

27:14.120 --> 27:16.480
Brother, I've found evidence
against the killer.

27:17.440 --> 27:19.400
I heard from Qingshi. Well done.

27:19.480 --> 27:22.160
You really went to the Xue house?

27:23.280 --> 27:24.200
And told him about it?

27:25.280 --> 27:27.080
He's Lord Xue's only son.

27:27.160 --> 27:29.160
If it were me, I'd let him escape.

27:29.240 --> 27:31.160
But he's the Grand Justice.

27:31.240 --> 27:33.680
He can't violate the law knowingly.

27:39.080 --> 27:41.720
It's precisely
because Lord Xue knows the law

27:41.800 --> 27:44.160
that his crimes cause even more harm.

27:48.520 --> 27:50.200
Sir, Lord Xue and his son are here

27:50.280 --> 27:51.640
to turn themselves in.

28:06.840 --> 28:08.120
Bring them to court.

28:21.640 --> 28:22.560
Yang Zigao,

28:22.640 --> 28:24.040
the magistrate summons you.

28:27.120 --> 28:30.360
JUSTICE PREVAILS

28:31.320 --> 28:32.600
Zheng Su'e,

28:33.160 --> 28:34.640
look at these four men carefully.

28:35.360 --> 28:36.520
Among them,

28:37.400 --> 28:39.920
which one killed your husband?

28:42.560 --> 28:44.320
SILENCE

28:48.400 --> 28:49.520
Audacious woman.

28:50.680 --> 28:53.560
You don't even know me,

28:53.640 --> 28:55.800
yet you accuse me?
Think it can clear your name?

28:57.560 --> 28:58.720
The three of you, leave.

29:04.160 --> 29:06.520
On March 16th last year,

29:06.600 --> 29:09.360
you took Zheng into your manor as a maid.

29:09.440 --> 29:11.640
You coveted her beauty,

29:11.720 --> 29:13.960
constantly harassing her.

29:14.040 --> 29:15.680
But Zheng was virtuous

29:15.760 --> 29:17.000
and firmly refused.

29:18.040 --> 29:19.440
On April 3rd,

29:19.520 --> 29:21.600
to avoid your abuse,

29:21.680 --> 29:23.800
Zheng fled back home alone.

29:23.880 --> 29:25.680
Had you stopped then,

29:25.760 --> 29:27.480
you might've redeemed yourself.

29:27.560 --> 29:29.520
But instead,

29:29.600 --> 29:31.000
you followed her.

29:31.760 --> 29:33.520
On Buddha's birthday, April 8th,

29:33.600 --> 29:35.600
when Granny Zhang
left to pray at the temple,

29:35.680 --> 29:38.280
you broke into her house again.

29:38.360 --> 29:40.120
Zheng resisted your advances.

29:40.200 --> 29:41.440
In anger, you struck her

29:41.520 --> 29:43.360
and broke one of her teeth.

29:44.000 --> 29:46.640
Her husband, Zhang Min,
hearing her screams,

29:46.720 --> 29:49.200
rushed in with a knife to save her.

29:49.280 --> 29:50.840
You and two servants

29:51.520 --> 29:53.440
killed him.

29:54.480 --> 29:56.040
What Lord Shen claims

29:56.120 --> 29:59.080
is baseless conjecture.

29:59.160 --> 30:01.360
Where's the evidence?

30:01.440 --> 30:04.000
Bring in Han Neng and Wang Hong.

30:07.320 --> 30:09.640
Han Neng, Wang Hong,
both are your servants.

30:09.720 --> 30:11.000
They've confessed everything.

30:11.080 --> 30:14.560
Don't tell me you don't know them.

30:14.640 --> 30:17.720
These two are indeed my servants.

30:17.800 --> 30:19.800
But days ago,

30:19.880 --> 30:23.200
I drove them out

30:23.280 --> 30:25.720
for stealing silverware.

30:25.800 --> 30:28.560
They hold a grudge

30:29.240 --> 30:30.400
and made this up.

30:30.480 --> 30:31.960
What are you talking about?

30:32.040 --> 30:34.280
We had no quarrel with Zhang.

30:34.360 --> 30:35.880
Why would we kill him?

30:35.960 --> 30:36.800
My lord,

30:36.880 --> 30:39.840
the silverware was his bribe to us.

30:39.920 --> 30:41.120
It was hush money, I swear.

30:41.200 --> 30:44.120
That silverware was my mother's treasure.

30:44.200 --> 30:46.280
How could I just give it away?

30:46.360 --> 30:49.000
If you don't believe me,
search their homes.

30:49.080 --> 30:50.040
You'll see.

30:50.720 --> 30:52.880
I even reported the theft back then.

30:52.960 --> 30:55.600
It was too trivial

30:56.440 --> 30:57.880
to trouble you with.

30:58.480 --> 30:59.760
So,

30:59.840 --> 31:02.440
they framed you for firing them?

31:02.520 --> 31:04.360
Why would the magistrate

31:05.000 --> 31:07.080
cut her tongue?

31:07.160 --> 31:08.720
Bring in Yang Zigao.

31:12.840 --> 31:13.840
My lord.

31:13.920 --> 31:15.440
Yang Zigao died in custody.

31:46.960 --> 31:51.520
Lord Shen, apart from these two servants,

31:51.600 --> 31:53.600
if there's no other proof,

31:53.680 --> 31:56.840
I must leave for a lecture at the academy.

31:56.920 --> 31:59.320
I'll take my leave.

32:02.640 --> 32:05.240
SILENCE

32:17.440 --> 32:20.120
- Let go!
- You husband-killing wretch!

32:20.200 --> 32:22.080
I'll cut you to pieces!

32:22.160 --> 32:23.000
Pull her back.

32:26.320 --> 32:27.880
Stop!

32:31.240 --> 32:32.440
Pull them back.

32:36.160 --> 32:39.240
Zheng said she bit

32:39.320 --> 32:41.160
the killer's left shoulder.

32:41.760 --> 32:42.640
Guards.

32:42.720 --> 32:43.960
Check his shoulder.

32:44.040 --> 32:45.480
Shen Huizhao!

32:46.560 --> 32:49.600
My father treated you as family.

32:49.680 --> 32:51.760
How dare you betray him?

32:52.720 --> 32:53.920
You heartless snake.

32:54.520 --> 32:55.560
Do it.

33:25.920 --> 33:28.000
SILENCE

33:37.480 --> 33:38.920
My lord,

33:39.000 --> 33:41.440
the old and new bite marks match.

33:41.520 --> 33:43.360
Even the broken tooth aligns perfectly.

33:44.480 --> 33:46.040
Xue Sizu, how dare you!

33:46.120 --> 33:47.920
You deny knowing Zheng Su'e,

33:48.000 --> 33:50.400
so how did she know about your bite mark?

33:50.480 --> 33:52.480
Confess,
or you'll be flogged to death here.

34:57.200 --> 34:58.520
Brother,

34:58.600 --> 35:00.680
did Lord Xue truly know nothing

35:00.760 --> 35:02.640
of his son's actions?

35:14.200 --> 35:15.080
My lifesaver!

35:15.160 --> 35:17.080
Please, no need for this. Get up.

35:25.000 --> 35:26.640
No, no, take it back.

35:27.280 --> 35:28.480
Take it.

35:31.400 --> 35:33.880
Go home and live a good life.

35:55.600 --> 35:58.040
Escort them safely home, then report back.

35:58.120 --> 35:59.120
Understood.

36:22.760 --> 36:24.400
You saved them.

36:24.480 --> 36:25.360
Why are you crying?

36:26.080 --> 36:27.120
I don't know.

36:27.720 --> 36:31.640
All those wronged will be compensated.
They'll be given coins and cloths.

36:31.720 --> 36:33.600
Once they're home,

36:34.480 --> 36:35.680
life will better.

36:36.280 --> 36:38.440
But I just feel like crying.

36:41.320 --> 36:42.400
Then cry for a bit.

36:50.080 --> 36:51.800
Cover your eyes
with some soaked packs later.

36:52.480 --> 36:54.480
We came for hiking,

36:54.560 --> 36:56.320
not for tears.

36:56.400 --> 36:57.960
Granny might think I upset you.

37:06.280 --> 37:07.280
Okay,

37:08.120 --> 37:09.280
let's go back.

37:11.560 --> 37:12.400
Brother.

37:12.480 --> 37:13.640
That's it?

37:14.200 --> 37:16.400
I need more consolation.

37:16.480 --> 37:17.800
Didn't you promise Granny

37:17.880 --> 37:19.280
you'd take me to hike?

37:19.920 --> 37:21.440
I gave you the choice.

37:21.520 --> 37:22.600
You chose to see them off.

37:23.840 --> 37:25.360
But brother…

37:25.440 --> 37:27.960
Then have tea with me
before we leave, right?

37:28.040 --> 37:29.800
If not, buy me some lamb skewers.

37:29.880 --> 37:32.720
That works too! Please?

37:32.800 --> 37:35.160
Brother, I'm starving.

37:35.240 --> 37:36.600
I'm begging you.

37:41.360 --> 37:43.480
This looks nice, so fresh!

37:44.120 --> 37:46.840
Smells amazing.

37:46.920 --> 37:48.640
Miss, take a look.

37:48.720 --> 37:49.560
Homegrown.

37:49.640 --> 37:50.640
Stop the cart.

37:50.720 --> 37:52.040
Stop.

37:52.120 --> 37:54.160
- All good!
- Pick some fresh ones for me.

37:54.960 --> 37:57.200
This is good, right?

37:58.000 --> 37:59.160
Take your time.

37:59.240 --> 38:00.520
I like this one.

38:00.600 --> 38:02.400
Sir,

38:02.480 --> 38:04.400
take your pick.

38:04.480 --> 38:06.040
Try this one for me. Looks nice.

38:10.440 --> 38:11.880
- Okay.
- Is it good?

38:11.960 --> 38:13.760
- Sure.
- How about this one on me?

38:13.840 --> 38:15.280
Here, try it.

38:15.360 --> 38:16.400
Let me see.

38:17.680 --> 38:19.920
Nice taste, sir.

38:20.000 --> 38:22.520
This jade ring is finely crafted.

38:22.600 --> 38:25.160
The paired ducks symbolize love.

38:25.240 --> 38:26.520
A perfect gift for your wife.

38:26.600 --> 38:27.720
Everyone loves it.

38:28.320 --> 38:29.680
This one suits you well too.

38:30.440 --> 38:31.880
This bracelet's lovely.

38:33.520 --> 38:34.480
I'll take this one.

38:34.560 --> 38:36.400
Wrap this up.

38:36.480 --> 38:37.560
Of course, right away.

38:38.200 --> 38:39.240
No need for that.

38:55.480 --> 38:56.840
Snap out of it.

38:59.160 --> 39:01.800
Haode, yesterday,

39:01.880 --> 39:03.200
did something nice happen?

39:04.960 --> 39:06.080
Nothing special.

39:06.920 --> 39:08.480
Then, tell me

39:08.560 --> 39:10.960
why you're giggling like this.

39:11.040 --> 39:13.080
I'm not giggling.

39:30.360 --> 39:31.920
My lady, the old lady sent a gift.

39:32.000 --> 39:33.200
Some fine bird's nest

39:33.280 --> 39:34.880
and fresh porridge.

39:34.960 --> 39:36.600
It's just been cooked.

39:36.680 --> 39:38.640
- Leave it here.
- Sure.

39:47.600 --> 39:48.760
Did she hear everything?

39:48.840 --> 39:50.760
She's already suspicious.

39:50.840 --> 39:52.080
Always probing for answers.

39:52.760 --> 39:53.920
Now she has proof.

39:54.000 --> 39:55.080
What is she going to do?

39:57.600 --> 39:58.800
She's going to tell them!

40:02.440 --> 40:03.480
Just now,

40:03.560 --> 40:05.680
outside her room, I heard them.

40:05.760 --> 40:08.040
She said that's her sister.

40:10.760 --> 40:14.040
Jinming Pool is bustling today.

40:14.120 --> 40:17.400
Boats and performances are everywhere.

40:17.480 --> 40:20.520
Those swinging on water swings.

40:21.440 --> 40:24.080
They look like they're flying in the wind.

40:24.840 --> 40:26.760
It's even livelier than previous years.

40:26.840 --> 40:28.920
You have a day off.

40:29.000 --> 40:32.480
Take your new wife out for a stroll.

40:32.560 --> 40:33.680
Don't let

40:34.720 --> 40:38.440
your young bride feel bored.

40:39.440 --> 40:40.600
You're right, Granny.

40:48.160 --> 40:49.520
My grandson,

40:49.600 --> 40:51.480
you always agree but never act on it.

40:52.320 --> 40:54.440
Every time I ask you to go out,

40:54.520 --> 40:57.000
you sulk and look so gloomy.

40:58.680 --> 41:01.280
It's hard to tell
if it's an outing or a funeral.

41:02.160 --> 41:04.480
With this attitude,

41:04.560 --> 41:06.400
when will I see my great-grandkids?

41:07.760 --> 41:10.280
Granny, I'm here to greet you.

41:10.360 --> 41:11.400
Come in.

41:15.920 --> 41:17.160
Best wishes, Granny.

41:18.440 --> 41:19.280
Oh, you're here too?

41:20.040 --> 41:20.960
And this is?

41:22.680 --> 41:24.280
I must apologize, Granny.

41:24.360 --> 41:25.960
When I visited my family,

41:26.040 --> 41:27.440
I told them

41:27.520 --> 41:30.040
how kind you are to me.

41:30.120 --> 41:31.440
You treat me like family.

41:32.080 --> 41:34.080
But my sister didn't believe me.

41:34.160 --> 41:36.720
She said no in-laws could be so lenient.

41:36.800 --> 41:38.080
She thought it wasn't real.

41:38.760 --> 41:40.920
I invited her here, but she hesitated.

41:41.600 --> 41:44.960
She said she needed to disguise herself

41:45.040 --> 41:46.520
as a maid to test it.

41:46.600 --> 41:48.520
Now, she finally believes me.

41:48.600 --> 41:51.440
That such kind,

41:51.520 --> 41:53.200
understanding elders exist.

41:53.280 --> 41:55.000
She changed clothes to greet you.

41:55.080 --> 41:57.720
Please forgive her boldness, Granny.

42:04.920 --> 42:06.640
She wanted to report this earlier,

42:06.720 --> 42:08.600
but I told her to wait and observe longer.

42:09.240 --> 42:11.440
Since you spoke so highly of Granny,

42:12.280 --> 42:14.280
our family must live up to your words.

42:14.880 --> 42:17.040
Invite someone to test us,

42:17.120 --> 42:20.160
so the truth can be spread.

42:20.840 --> 42:24.360
You make it sound like I seek praise.

42:25.160 --> 42:28.120
That's why

42:28.200 --> 42:31.560
I thought this girl resembled you,

42:31.640 --> 42:33.600
and now I know she's family.

42:35.160 --> 42:36.440
Granny,

42:36.520 --> 42:38.440
I followed my sister's carriage here.

42:38.520 --> 42:41.240
She was shocked
and wanted to send me back.

42:41.320 --> 42:43.200
I insisted on staying, no matter what.

42:43.280 --> 42:45.600
Please don't blame her for hiding this.

42:46.880 --> 42:49.240
You all kept this from me so well.

42:49.320 --> 42:50.280
Who says I'm not upset?

42:58.680 --> 43:00.080
Come here quickly.

43:03.600 --> 43:06.360
I love cheerful, flower-like girls.

43:06.440 --> 43:07.880
You should

43:08.680 --> 43:11.200
stay here longer.

43:11.840 --> 43:13.840
Keep your sister company

43:13.920 --> 43:15.360
and amuse me.

43:15.440 --> 43:17.120
Consider it making up for your offense.

43:17.200 --> 43:18.720
Another day,

43:19.480 --> 43:22.880
we'll go out together.

43:22.960 --> 43:24.320
Granny,

43:24.400 --> 43:26.120
I still have work at the office.

43:26.200 --> 43:27.600
I can't be with you.

43:27.680 --> 43:28.760
I'm sorry.

43:28.840 --> 43:31.120
Who's asking you to come along?

43:31.200 --> 43:33.200
You're such a buzzkill every day.

43:34.240 --> 43:36.600
Haode, accompany me instead.

43:37.520 --> 43:38.600
Sure.

43:44.720 --> 43:45.880
This way.

43:51.880 --> 43:54.160
Liu, a word with you.

43:54.240 --> 43:55.320
Sure.

44:07.880 --> 44:10.280
Anything happening in her room,
small or big,

44:10.360 --> 44:12.080
will be learned by Granny

44:12.160 --> 44:13.240
within an hour.

44:14.440 --> 44:16.080
You've had a bias against my wife.

44:16.160 --> 44:19.080
You often spoke ill of her before Granny.

44:19.160 --> 44:21.400
Did you think I wouldn't notice?

44:22.000 --> 44:23.080
Master,

44:23.160 --> 44:24.680
I only did it for you

44:24.760 --> 44:25.920
and this family.

44:26.000 --> 44:27.200
I have no selfish intent.

44:27.280 --> 44:30.040
You claim to serve Granny loyally,

44:30.120 --> 44:32.040
but instead,

44:32.120 --> 44:36.000
you stir trouble and gossip.

44:36.080 --> 44:40.480
You spy on your masters
yet call yourself a devoted servant?

44:42.360 --> 44:44.080
She's my wife.

44:44.680 --> 44:46.240
Whether she's good or bad,

44:46.320 --> 44:49.320
she is not someone for you to judge.

44:49.400 --> 44:50.560
There's no place for you.

44:50.640 --> 44:53.080
Find a reason and resign.

44:54.440 --> 44:57.920
I'm sorry, Master. I won't do it again.

44:58.840 --> 45:00.800
Please help me, my lady.

45:02.320 --> 45:03.520
My lord,

45:03.600 --> 45:05.080
if Liu leaves,

45:05.160 --> 45:06.960
Granny may be upset.

45:07.040 --> 45:08.880
Why not let her stay,

45:08.960 --> 45:11.080
serve Granny more loyally,

45:11.160 --> 45:12.800
and make amends?

45:16.440 --> 45:18.280
- Thank you, sir.
- Not me.

45:18.360 --> 45:20.120
If you want to thank someone,

45:20.200 --> 45:22.040
thank my wife, the mistress
of the Family Shen.

45:23.240 --> 45:25.680
I've been foolish and offensive.

45:25.760 --> 45:28.520
It's generous for you to forgive me.

45:28.600 --> 45:31.320
I will improve

45:31.400 --> 45:32.960
and serve faithfully,

45:33.040 --> 45:34.800
never speaking out of turn again.

45:36.280 --> 45:37.520
That's okay. Go.

45:44.080 --> 45:45.920
Brother.

45:46.000 --> 45:49.000
You finally admit I'm your wife?

46:14.120 --> 46:15.520
Make up for the one you gave away.

46:21.720 --> 46:23.320
Don't overthink it.

46:23.400 --> 46:25.240
Don't think too much. Don't.

46:42.240 --> 46:43.120
Who's that?

46:44.160 --> 46:45.400
A new ministry officer.

46:45.480 --> 46:46.760
He's solved several big cases.

46:46.840 --> 46:49.520
He is a sharp young man,
highly regarded by the lord.

46:54.040 --> 46:55.640
Skilled and talented.

46:57.120 --> 46:58.000
Is he married yet?

47:02.720 --> 47:03.960
Master Qiao,

47:04.040 --> 47:05.880
every Dragon Boat Festival,

47:05.960 --> 47:08.640
we place zongzi outside to honor the gods.

47:08.720 --> 47:10.240
It always draws a crowd.

47:10.320 --> 47:12.480
Red date, pine nut, chestnut.

47:12.560 --> 47:14.800
Walnut, ginger, persimmon, ginkgo.

47:14.880 --> 47:18.400
Round, pointed, pagoda-shaped,
nine-layered.

47:18.480 --> 47:20.160
Name it, she makes it.

47:20.760 --> 47:22.160
Of all our sisters,

47:22.240 --> 47:24.520
only Qiongnu can do such work.

47:24.600 --> 47:27.440
No one else can compare.

47:28.080 --> 47:31.200
And this, five-colored rice cakes.

47:32.800 --> 47:35.120
If you don't try one, how do you know?

47:36.600 --> 47:38.760
If you don't try one,

47:38.840 --> 47:40.920
how do you know?

47:47.400 --> 47:48.480
Take it slow.

47:48.560 --> 47:49.800
Have some tea.

47:50.640 --> 47:52.160
Don't choke.

47:55.360 --> 47:56.280
My lord,

47:56.360 --> 47:58.440
I'm here to report a case.

47:59.040 --> 48:00.880
I bumped into Master Qiao

48:00.960 --> 48:02.800
and asked him over.

48:03.760 --> 48:05.040
It didn't delay the matter.

48:05.720 --> 48:08.240
Don't be upset, brother.

48:08.320 --> 48:10.080
How's the case going?

48:11.360 --> 48:14.240
Sir, Deng and Ji
had a betrothal agreement.

48:15.000 --> 48:17.080
The Ji was wealthy but fell into poverty.

48:17.160 --> 48:18.640
Three years ago,

48:18.720 --> 48:20.320
the Deng's tried to annul the marriage.

48:20.400 --> 48:23.000
The Ji's sued and took it to Kaifeng.

48:23.080 --> 48:25.840
The court ruled against the Deng's.

48:25.920 --> 48:28.240
They were ordered to marry as planned.

48:28.320 --> 48:30.200
They lived harmoniously afterward.

48:30.280 --> 48:31.520
But last month,

48:31.600 --> 48:33.880
Madam Ji died suddenly during childbirth.

48:33.960 --> 48:36.640
After the funeral,
the Deng's buried her quickly.

48:36.720 --> 48:39.000
The Ji's, living far away,

48:39.080 --> 48:40.080
arrived too late.

48:40.160 --> 48:41.800
She was already buried.

48:41.880 --> 48:44.200
She had a maid with her named Ah Tao.

48:44.800 --> 48:47.400
She claimed that Deng killed her mistress.

48:47.480 --> 48:50.040
The hasty burial was to cover it up.

48:50.120 --> 48:52.480
The case caused quite a stir.

48:52.560 --> 48:53.960
So many are talking about it.

48:54.040 --> 48:55.920
But there's been no resolution.

49:00.040 --> 49:01.640
Then, open the coffin for inspection.

49:03.240 --> 49:05.800
Sir, exhuming a body is a grave matter.

49:05.880 --> 49:07.840
If we find nothing,

49:07.920 --> 49:09.440
the Deng's might retaliate,

49:09.520 --> 49:10.760
harming your reputation.

49:10.840 --> 49:14.400
The living can tell a hundred lies.

49:14.480 --> 49:17.360
But the dead can only tell the truth.

49:18.360 --> 49:19.440
If the Deng's protest,

49:19.520 --> 49:21.080
I'll take full responsibility.

49:21.160 --> 49:22.160
Just go.

49:22.240 --> 49:23.360
Understood.

49:24.960 --> 49:26.000
Master Qiao.

49:26.640 --> 49:27.960
Master Qiao.

49:29.120 --> 49:31.320
Why do you run faster when I call you?

49:31.400 --> 49:33.080
I'm not done talking.

49:34.880 --> 49:36.600
Isn't he acting strange?

49:37.640 --> 49:38.760
Are you done?

49:39.760 --> 49:41.000
Then go back.

